  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>잠시 문제가 생겼어요</title>
  </head>
  <body class="flex min-h-dvh items-center justify-center px-6 text-center">
    <main>
      <p class="text-6xl" aria-hidden="true">🍲</p>
      <h1 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-extrabold">잠시 문제가 생겼어요</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-ink-2">일시적인 오류예요. 잠시 후 새로고침해 주세요.</p>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary mt-8">홈으로</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
